  "details": "This would allow different instances of the same world to communicate. e.g. at least my idea is a custom matchmaking system that can communicate across all instances and then transmit player location and voice data across instances. This could either include all instances in the region (e.g. US-west) or just be all of the instances. Additionally, it could be limited to not include invite and invite only instances, and only work with friends+ and above. This would allow e.g. my idea is a sort of system where people can join and find people who's interests match theirs. This doesn't really work out well with only 40 players, for instance, but if it was able to communicate across all public instances of the world, then that would make it much more effective. Here is my awesome drawing because there was an image button here lmao. *****I know this might only be useful for this one single use case but if anyone needs it for any other reason please speak up or else this isnt gonna go anywhere!!",
